    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/d5377a64568bb839d02bb28ede5c7f9c.avif?t=1737169721\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey in <strong>Road Island Adventure</strong>, an open-world RPG set in a vibrant world of living cars! Compete in high-stakes races, uncover the mysteries of a strange signal, and build your dream community while exploring a diverse island full of charm and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/e7f3a2c3e424e12d6b84d26071bd39f1.poster.avif?t=1737169721\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/e7f3a2c3e424e12d6b84d26071bd39f1.webm?t=1737169721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/e7f3a2c3e424e12d6b84d26071bd39f1.mp4?t=1737169721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/9c0294ce57960b04bbe719a618ea639e.avif?t=1737169721\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race for Glory</strong><br>Compete in the legendary Road Island Rally, recruiting teammates and upgrading powerful parts to form your ultimate racing team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Island</strong><br>Traverse diverse biomes with gadgets like gliders and jet thrusters, uncovering hidden paths and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Town</strong><br>Recruit residents, customize buildings, and upgrade your town to unlock perks and boost your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Upgrade</strong><br>Collect resources to craft and upgrade rare parts, fine-tuning your vehicle to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery</strong><br>Face a rogue AI reactivating primitive systems to control the island's residents. Race &amp; explore to uncover its secrets and save the island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games &amp; Perks</strong><br>Take on fun mini-games like Curling and Golf, and unlock perks to boost speed, enhance gadgets, and uncover hidden areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/777546078edda86e6c54f91c53460702.poster.avif?t=1737169721\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/777546078edda86e6c54f91c53460702.webm?t=1737169721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/777546078edda86e6c54f91c53460702.mp4?t=1737169721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road Island Adventure</strong> blends arcade racing and RPG elements for a thrilling open-world experience! Get ready to race, explore, and build your legacy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/d5377a64568bb839d02bb28ede5c7f9c.avif?t=1737169721\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey in <strong>Road Island Adventure</strong>, an open-world RPG set in a vibrant world of living cars! Compete in high-stakes races, uncover the mysteries of a strange signal, and build your dream community while exploring a diverse island full of charm and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/e7f3a2c3e424e12d6b84d26071bd39f1.poster.avif?t=1737169721\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/e7f3a2c3e424e12d6b84d26071bd39f1.webm?t=1737169721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/e7f3a2c3e424e12d6b84d26071bd39f1.mp4?t=1737169721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/9c0294ce57960b04bbe719a618ea639e.avif?t=1737169721\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race for Glory</strong><br>Compete in the legendary Road Island Rally, recruiting teammates and upgrading powerful parts to form your ultimate racing team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Island</strong><br>Traverse diverse biomes with gadgets like gliders and jet thrusters, uncovering hidden paths and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Town</strong><br>Recruit residents, customize buildings, and upgrade your town to unlock perks and boost your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Upgrade</strong><br>Collect resources to craft and upgrade rare parts, fine-tuning your vehicle to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery</strong><br>Face a rogue AI reactivating primitive systems to control the island's residents. Race &amp; explore to uncover its secrets and save the island!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games &amp; Perks</strong><br>Take on fun mini-games like Curling and Golf, and unlock perks to boost speed, enhance gadgets, and uncover hidden areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/777546078edda86e6c54f91c53460702.poster.avif?t=1737169721\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/777546078edda86e6c54f91c53460702.webm?t=1737169721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414890/extras/777546078edda86e6c54f91c53460702.mp4?t=1737169721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road Island Adventure</strong> blends arcade racing and RPG elements for a thrilling open-world experience! Get ready to race, explore, and build your legacy!</p>",
    "short_description": "An open-world RPG in a world of living cars. Race in high-stakes events, explore a vibrant island with diverse gadgets, build your own town, and recruit teammates. Complete quests, gather resources, and uncover the mystery behind a strange signal. Adventure and discovery await!",
